OL,3,AOne dead as nor'easter storm pummels
OL,4,ANew York and New Jersey
OL,5,
OL,6,FTens of millions of people across the
OL,7,Fnorth-eastern US have found themselves
OL,8,Fin the path of a powerful weekend storm
OL,9,Fbringing coastal flooding, power cuts,
OL,10,Ftravel chaos and cancelled stadium
OL,11,Fevents.
OL,13,FThe so-called nor'easter brought
OL,14,F"dangerous coastal flooding and beach
OL,15,Fconditions, strong winds and heavy
OL,16,Frainfall" to areas including New York
OL,17,FCity and Boston on Saturday, the US
OL,18,FNational Weather Service (NWS) said.
OL,23,APub: 26-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
