OL,3,AOne dead as nor'easter storm pummels
OL,4,ANew York and New Jersey
OL,5,
OL,6,FStates of emergency have been declared
OL,7,Fin New York and New Jersey, both of
OL,8,Fwhich faced a coastal deluge in some
OL,9,Fareas. Rain and strong winds were
OL,10,Fforecast from Virginia to Maine.
OL,12,FIn Brooklyn, New York City, a man was
OL,13,Fkilled by a falling tree.
